      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.50 (up from ₹0.39 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.60b (up 3.6% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹44.5m (up 27% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.7% (up from 1.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
